  "Bake the mesh maps first (Texture Set Settings › Bake Mesh Maps).": { ca: "Primer fes el bake dels mesh maps (Texture Set Settings › Bake Mesh Maps).", es: "Primero haz el bake de los mesh maps (Texture Set Settings › Bake Mesh Maps)." },
